  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Turns the OWASP Top 10:2025 (A01:2025 to A10:2025, final release December 2025) into a review and prioritization workflow for web applications. The 2025 edition is current; the 2021 and 2017 editions are legacy; no newer edition or release candidate exists, so there is no preview. SKILL.md holds the access control, injection, configuration, supply chain, cryptography, authentication, integrity, logging and fail-closed invariants and the review workflow; references cover the version lines with the 2021 to 2025 and 2017 to 2021 mappings, each category with its data, description, prevention, scenarios and mapped CWEs, and a checklist with a classification table for borderline findings.",
